---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const TITLE = "LIC Jeevan Anand vs Jeevan Labh: Which Plan is Best for You in 2026?";
const DESCRIPTION = "A detailed comparison of LIC Jeevan Anand (Plan 915) vs. LIC Jeevan Labh (Plan 936). Understand the key differences to choose the right plan for your goals.";
const KEYWORDS = "Jeevan Anand vs Jeevan Labh, LIC plan comparison 2026, LIC Jeevan Anand vs Jeevan Labh benefits, which LIC plan is best";
const CANONICAL_URL = "https://insurancesupport.online/blog/lic-jeevan-anand-vs-jeevan-labh-comparison/";
const AUTHOR_NAME = "Hari Kotian";
const PUBLISH_DATE = "2026-07-25";

const COMPARISON_SCHEMA = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Table",
  "name": "Comparison: Jeevan Anand vs Jeevan Labh",
  "about": "Comparison of LIC plan benefits"
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title={TITLE}
  description={DESCRIPTION}
  keywords={KEYWORDS}
  canonical={CANONICAL_URL}
>
  <main id="main" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(COMPARISON_SCHEMA)} />
    
    <nav class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-blue-600">Blog</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      <span class="text-slate-700">Jeevan Anand vs Jeevan Labh Comparison</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-blue-900 mb-6">{TITLE}</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">By {AUTHOR_NAME} | Published on {PUBLISH_DATE}</p>

    <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
      Choosing between LIC Jeevan Anand and LIC Jeevan Labh is one of the most common dilemmas for investors. 
      Both are powerful endowment plans, but they serve different financial objectives. This guide 
      compares their core features to help you make an informed decision for 2026.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Core Differences at a Glance</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8">
      <table class="min-w-full bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
        <thead class="bg-blue-800 text-white">
          <tr>
            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-left">Feature</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-left">Jeevan Anand (Plan 915)</th>
            <th class="py-3 px-4 text-left">Jeevan Labh (Plan 936)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="text-slate-700">
          <tr><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Plan Type</td><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Whole Life Endowment</td><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Limited Premium Endowment</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Maturity Benefit</td><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Sum Assured + Bonus</td><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Sum Assured + Bonus</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Death Cover</td><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Continues after maturity</td><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Ends at maturity</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Best For</td><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Lifetime protection & estate planning</td><td class="py-2 px-4 border-b">Medium-term goals (child education)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Detailed Breakdown</h2>
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">LIC Jeevan Anand (The "Lifetime" Plan)</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
      Jeevan Anand is unique because its life cover continues <strong>even after the policy matures</strong>. 
      If the policyholder survives the term, they receive the maturity value, but the risk cover 
      remains active until death. It is an excellent plan for estate planning.
    </p>
    
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">LIC Jeevan Labh (The "Short-Term" Saver)</h3>
    <p class="text-slate-700 mb-6">
      Jeevan Labh is designed for limited premium payments. You pay premiums for a shorter duration 
      than the total policy term, making it ideal for parents planning for their children's 
      education or marriage expenses occurring at a specific time in the future.
    </p>

    <div class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">Still Unsure?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
        Every investor's needs are different. Let's analyze your financial goals and 
        recommend the plan that fits you best.
      </p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/919986634506" class="inline-block bg-green-500 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg hover:bg-green-600 transition-colors">
        WhatsApp Hari Kotian
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
